    (:paradigm :n 11 :verdict :amend :by "Keep intended-failure gates; production fault sensitivity and independent expected behavior replace output labels as evidence." :tasks ["Task43605" "Task43901"])
  ]
  :decision "Settle six ordered phases: Phase436 semantics and honest verification; Phase437 canonical rule/client projections; Phase438 observable portable native/WASM core and truthful batches; Phase439 independent production-fault, cost and claim evidence; Phase440 autonomous ASL native compiler/evaluator stage2 rebuild and all tooling; Phase441 attention/session isolation and measured compression. Task dependency edges govern scheduling; serialize overlapping writers. Existing tasks are amended rather than duplicated; runtime implementation and behavioral baselines remain pending."
